{
  "headline": "PCB Lead Times Hit 140 Days as AI Demand Strains Supply",
  "account": "company",
  "caption": "PCB lead times for advanced materials have reached 140 days, up from weeks just two years ago.\nStandard FR-4 laminates that once shipped in 5 days now take 18 days. High-Tg and specialty laminates face even longer waits.\nAI server demand is up 340% year over year, placing unprecedented pressure on laminate and copper supply chains. Copper prices have climbed to $13,300 per tonne on the LME.\nProcurement teams across the industry are adapting with longer planning horizons and strategic inventory buffers.\nWhat lead time changes are you seeing in your supply chain?\nSources:\nILFA GmbH \u2014 https://ilfa.de\n#PCBManufacturing #SupplyChain #AIHardware #ElectronicsIndustry #CopperPrices #Laminates",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#000;\">\n<div style=\"width:1920px;height:1080px;background:#12100e;position:relative;overflow:hidden;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#ffffff;\">\n\n<!-- Background PCB trace pattern -->\n<svg width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;opacity:0.07;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs>\n<pattern id=\"pcb\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n<circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6600\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"#ff6600\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"40\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#ff6600\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"40\" r=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6600\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"40\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#ff6600\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#ff6600\"/>\n<line x1=\"70\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#ff6600\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"70\" r=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6600\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<rect x=\"18\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6600\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" rx=\"1\"/>\n</pattern>\n</defs>\n<rect width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"url(#pcb)\"/>\n</svg>\n\n<!-- Radial gradient orb behind hero -->\n<div style=\"position:absolute;top:200px;left:200px;width:600px;height:600px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,102,0,0.1) 0%,transparent 70%);border-radius:50%;\"></div>\n\n<!-- Radial gradient orb bottom right -->\n<div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:100px;right:200px;width:400px;height:400px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,102,0,0.06) 0%,transparent 70%);border-radius:50%;\"></div>\n\n<!-- Main content container -->\n<div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:1920px;height:1080px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;padding:50px 80px 0 80px;\">\n\n<!-- Top bar: logo + label -->\n<div style=\"width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:40px;\">\n<img alt=\"Cu Circuits\" src=\"\" style=\"height:72px;width:auto;\" />\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\">Supply Chain Intelligence</div>\n<div style=\"width:72px;\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Two column layout -->\n<div style=\"width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;flex:1;gap:60px;max-height:840px;\">\n\n<!-- LEFT COLUMN: Hero -->\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;\">\n\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ff6600;margin-bottom:24px;\">Advanced Laminate Lead Time</div>\n\n<div style=\"font-size:110px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-3px;color:#ff6600;line-height:1;\">140</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:34px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);margin-top:8px;\">Days</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:32px;font-size:22px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);max-width:600px;text-align:center;\">\nHigh-Tg and advanced laminates now require 140 day lead times, driven by surging AI server demand and constrained raw material supply.\n</div>\n\n<!-- Before/After bar comparison SVG -->\n<div style=\"margin-top:48px;width:100%;max-width:520px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin-bottom:20px;text-align:center;\">Standard FR-4 Lead Time Shift</div>\n<svg width=\"520\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;\">\n<!-- Before bar -->\n<text x=\"260\" y=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui\">BEFORE</text>\n<rect x=\"210\" y=\"24\" width=\"100\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.15)\"/>\n<text x=\"260\" y=\"42\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui\">5 days</text>\n<!-- After bar -->\n<text x=\"260\" y=\"68\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui\">NOW</text>\n<rect x=\"128\" y=\"74\" width=\"264\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ff6600\"/>\n<text x=\"260\" y=\"92\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui\">18 days</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- Vertical divider -->\n<div style=\"width:2px;height:600px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent,rgba(255,102,0,0.3),rgba(255,102,0,0.3),transparent);flex-shrink:0;\"></div>\n\n<!-- RIGHT COLUMN: Supporting data -->\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;gap:48px;\">\n\n<!-- AI Server Demand stat with bar chart -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin-bottom:12px;\">AI Server Demand Growth (YoY)</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:52px;font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;line-height:1;\">+340%</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:300;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin-top:8px;\">Year over year increase</div>\n<!-- Mini bar chart showing growth -->\n<svg width=\"300\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 80\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"display:block;margin:16px auto 0 auto;\">\n<text x=\"50\" y=\"75\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.4)\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui\">2023</text>\n<rect x=\"25\" y=\"48\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.15)\"/>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"75\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.4)\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui\">2024</text>\n<rect x=\"125\" y=\"28\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"rgba(255,102,0,0.4)\"/>\n<text x=\"250\" y=\"75\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.4)\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui\">2025</text>\n<rect x=\"225\" y=\"2\" width=\"50\" height=\"66\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#ff6600\"/>\n</svg>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Copper Price stat -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin-bottom:12px;\">Copper Spot Price</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:52px;font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;line-height:1;\">$13,300</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:300;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin-top:8px;\">Per tonne (LME)</div>\n<!-- Copper price line chart -->\n<svg width=\"300\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 60\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"display:block;margin:16px auto 0 auto;\">\n<polyline points=\"0,50 60,45 120,40 180,30 240,18 300,8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6600\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n<circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ff6600\"/>\n<line x1=\"0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<text x=\"0\" y=\"55\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"system-ui\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">2024</text>\n<text x=\"272\" y=\"55\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"system-ui\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">Now</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Impact callout -->\n<div style=\"border-left:4px solid #ff6600;padding-left:24px;text-align:center;max-width:480px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);text-align:center;\">\nProcurement teams are shifting to 6 month forward planning as standard lead times stretch across the board.\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- Footer -->\n<div style=\"width:100%;margin-top:auto;padding-bottom:40px;\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);margin-bottom:16px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\">cucircuits.com</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);text-align:right;\">Source: ILFA GmbH</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
}